sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Reviewer
  participant A as App shell and state
  participant D as Browser storage
  participant G as GitHub client
  participant H as GitHub API
  participant E as Markdown editor
  U->>A: open #/owner/repo/blob/branch/path
  A->>D: save mardoc_current_repo
  A->>G: fetchRevision(branch)
  G->>H: read branch ref
  H-->>G: commit SHA
  A->>G: fetchRepoTree(SHA) in the background
  A->>G: fetchFileContent(path, SHA)
  G->>H: read file contents
  H-->>G: Markdown source
  G-->>A: content and revision
  A->>E: content and revision
  E->>D: resolveDraftOnLoad
  E-->>U: rendered document, restore offered if a draft differs
